	(text_box "Optical sensor input (currently GPIO 19 pin 35) \nwill be moved to GPIO 22 pin 15.  \nOutputs for controlling the two IR940 led panels used for transmission and reflectance illumination \n(currently on GPIO12 pin 32 and GPIO13 pin 33) will be moved to GPIO27 pin13 and GPIO17pin 11 respectively. \n\nGPIO12 (pin 32), GPIO13 (pin33), GPIO19 (pin35) \nwill then be rewired to control the Blue, RED and Far Red LEDs, \nrespectively via the 3 channel MOSFET ILRZ44N circuit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -119.38 124.4601 0)
		(size 109.22 22.8599)
